{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-core":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-core/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/sec-archimedean-condition-genus-preamble","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Prose","doco:Section"],"label":"sec:archimedean-condition-genus-preamble","kind":"prose","text":"archimedean-condition-genus-intro.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"sec:archimedean-condition-genus-preamble\"></a><p>A two-strand torus knot <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">T(2, 2k+1)</code> has Seifert genus <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">g(T(2, 2k+1)) = k</code>. Because an embedded incompressible Seifert surface on <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\Sigma_4</code> cannot have genus exceeding <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">g(\\Sigma_4) = 4</code>, the two-strand torus-knot tower truncates sharply at <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">k \\leq 4</code>, admitting only the unknot <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">0_1</code> (<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">g=0</code>), the trefoil <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">3_1</code> (<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">g=1</code>), the cinquefoil <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">5_1</code> (<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">g=2</code>), the septafoil <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">7_1</code> (<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">g=3</code>), and the nonafoil <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">9_1</code> (<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">g=4</code>). This section proves that the Chebyshev degree of the Hecke evaluation polynomials matches the Seifert genus and establishes the rank of the embeddable generator set.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/archimedean-condition-genus-intro.md","heading":"","page":"b/sec-archimedean-condition-genus-preamble","qa":{"counts":{"pass":57,"fail":0,"warn":0,"na":18,"unknown":0,"stale":58},"milnor":{"total":2,"notPassing":0}}}
